            "notes": "# Round 2\n\n## How?\n\nThis is where Brigitte can start tanking. With [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) you can start stacking overhealth. With [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) you passively heal on top.\n\n## Why these Powers/Items?\n[Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) provides overhealth every time you deal ability damage (Whip shot and each hit of [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8)). \n\n[Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) grants healing and speed anytime you hit an enemy with your primary fire. It also grants armour, further scaling the benefit of [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0).\n\nIf you cannot afford Gloom, take the other items to stack as much HP as possible and buff  [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) \n\nNote:\n*[Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) does not activate from the [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) projectile.*",
