            "notes": "# Round 3\n\n## How?\n\nTo get the most value from  [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422), throw 3 repair packs on a single target to give it the longest duration. Then chain  [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) and whipshot on enemies to extend the duration. Keep this cycle up. With good cooldown management you will stack so much duration that the armour packs can stay up for entire fights.\n\n## Why these Powers/Items?\n\nWith  [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422) Brigitte can keep her packs active on allies almost permanently. This is one of her strongest powers and synergizes very well with this playstyle.",
