            "notes": "# Round 5\n\n## How?\n\nAfter stacking repair pack on a single target, begin trying to spread the packs across allies and scaling it on multiple players.\n\nEvery player you stack repair pack to will passively heal you 5% every second, AND buff repair packs healing.\n\n\n## Why these Powers/Items?\n\nOur final power is  [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8). This will synergize with  [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422) incredibly well. \n\nOur final item is  [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e). As we are playing frontline, this allows us to gain repair packs faster in the downtime between Shield Bash and Whip shot.",
